{"title":"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A ball is dropped from a height of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> meters. On its first bounce it rises to a height of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> meters. It keeps falling and bouncing to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/7547747b133453d3c209cff6cfbf129aa67a6947.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> of the height it reached in the previous bounce. On which bounce will it not rise to a height of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/2/192b4a258ee998961a99523fd0f0a029f9ea194a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.5$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" /> meters?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/c/f6cc0a79cf017b65132366d3473db0814fe7dfa4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\  3 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\  4 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 6 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"349\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each bounce is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/b/38bd36e353df831303c0de895a9ec614cf3e7202.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2/3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" /> times the height of the previous bounce. The first bounce reaches <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> meters, the second <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/e/79eb8e19631d2e3949d5b0dedf357abbb6eb2bcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4/3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />, the third <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/8/b98798bfc9acc1e7314c4c84a9578e71fb7373c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8/9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />, the fourth <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/7/a27f769d0d8d0f5305b4dbc311201956718d81df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16/27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"47\" height=\"20\" />, and the fifth <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/b/04bbc0aecf544e30ecff451bc9b65fc13763d408.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32/81$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"18\" />. Half of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/e/87edbdda753b32453027dc7cab023c0743b6b243.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$81$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/3/c8368a5686c5eccb9a016c49de9252ad88850313.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"13\" />, so the ball does not reach the required height on bounce <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/d/f8d260a9a7112f522ac38809def477024784034c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8\" title=\"2008 AMC 8\">2008 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2008\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_8_Probl